# 运行产物
TeachingFlow/runs/
TeachingFlow/.work/
TeachingFlow/state/
TeachingFlow/dist/
TeachingFlow/recovered/
# 加密 material
.env
PPT-Agent/.env
# python
__pycache__/
*.pyc
# 第三方 skill（由 setup.ps1 拉取）
ppt-master/
# 系统文件
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
# 课堂原型（TeachingFlow/classroom/）：运行产物与二进制不入库
# .env 与 __pycache__/ 已由上面的通用规则在任意深度覆盖，这里不再重复
TeachingFlow/classroom/.cache/
TeachingFlow/classroom/.pytest_cache/
TeachingFlow/classroom/decks/*/media/
TeachingFlow/classroom/pptx/*.pptx
TeachingFlow/classroom/*.log
# 这两个是**运行期生成物**：run.py 每次起服务都按本机 host:port 与解释器重写一遍。
# 入库的后果是"任何人跑一次服务 git status 就脏"，而提交里那份路径/端口只对作者那台
# 机器有效 —— 新用户拿去用只会指向不存在的解释器。
TeachingFlow/classroom/mcp-access-prompt.md
TeachingFlow/classroom/mcp-config.json
# 首次本地备课写出的中间产物：内含机器绝对路径，同样不该入库
TeachingFlow/classroom/decks/*/source.txt
TeachingFlow/classroom/decks/*/plan.bak.json
TeachingFlow/classroom/webapp/node_modules/
